{"id":"697411292","kind":"article","title":"情景体验很难创作","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8r1EZL3sFrFe7brjiwFbFN"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2024-05-13","updated":"2024-05-18","votes":7,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":529,"keywords":["情景体验","游戏设计","组织设计","赋能环境","互动设计"],"summary":"作者认为，创作全新的情景体验缺少现成范式，但游戏设计与组织设计已各自积累一些可复用方法。若能归纳二者共通的技术，或许可以形成更通用的情景体验设计方法，帮助人们积极参与赋能环境。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/697411292","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"-7dOS9OV\">剧作家、小说家和演讲者可以借助已有的形式简化他们的创作。他们在解决问题或评估作品时，能够运用以往的模式、工具和方法。但相比之下，如果你打算设计一种全新的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z92TGMiBsnraf5KXxSTNkBJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，基本上是在无人之境中开辟道路。</p><p data-pid=\"3_3OwU_7\">当然，也有一些例外：游戏设计师在设计审美的情景体验时，已经形成了一套模式；而在组织设计中，也形成了通过情景体验来塑造团队文化和实践的模式。</p><p data-pid=\"VuCipLpg\">这两个领域的实践背后可能存在一些共通的技术和流程，这些技术和流程有望发展成为创设情景体验的通用方法。这种可能性非常激动人心，因为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zKubRcJXKjiCDPsPgJWckkP\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验可以引导人们积极参与到赋能环境中</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"8uo25EIX\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"698476935\" href=\"#/post/698476935\">§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》</a></li><li data-pid=\"geN7uH2t\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463926133\" href=\"#/post/463926133\">情景体验（Enacted experience）</a></li><li data-pid=\"DQXWV3VL\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"654019484\" href=\"#/post/654019484\">情景体验可以引导人们积极参与到赋能环境中</a></li><li data-pid=\"pCo_qjz3\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"697566052\" href=\"#/post/697566052\">超级《启蒙琼林》被嵌入到一个领域中，通过情景体验来引导学习者参与</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"J3OxF5wO\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 GPT-4，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z8r1EZL3sFrFe7brjiwFbFN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Enacted experiences are hard to author (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 情景体验（Enacted experience） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463926133\" href=\"#/post/463926133\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 情景体验可以引导人们积极参与到赋能环境中 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"654019484\" href=\"#/post/654019484\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"696092905","title":"「寻找乐趣」","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"697566052","title":"超级《启蒙琼林》被嵌入到一个领域中，通过情景体验来引导学习者参与","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"698476935","title":"§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"654019484","title":"情景体验可以引导人们积极参与到赋能环境中","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"463926133","title":"情景体验（Enacted experience）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":20,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}